 # Changelog
 
+## Unreleased
+
+- Discount codes: `SPRING10` takes 10 % off the items; `WELCOME5` takes 5.00 € off items of 30.00 € or more.
+  An order takes one code at most, given with `applyCode`.
+
 ## 1.4.0
 
 - Orders keep the date they were placed on.
